# Loaded automatically by `vite build --mode staging` (npm run build:staging).
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, not run time — there is no way to repoint a built bundle at
# a different API afterwards. A staging deploy built with the default `npm run build` would
# call production, which is exactly the class of mistake staging exists to catch.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://generationb-api-staging.onrender.com/api
